﻿1
00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:02.480
Bueno.

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:03.240
Okay.

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:08.240
Stop, stop, stop.

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:09.080
What are you doing?

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:09.920
No.

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:11.000
Tip number one:

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.560
close your eyes.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.560
Close your eyes, please.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:15.800
Gino, you too.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.440
Imagine something delightful.

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:23.720
Me, for example.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:25.320
I'm just kidding.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.600
Imagine

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:34.800
you're

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.160
seven years old.

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:42.640
There are no problems,

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:45.680
no bad things,

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:50.480
only happiness and bright future.

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:55.440
Your mom just has left freshly

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:58.320
baked pie in the kitchen.

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:01.440
It smells like...

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:05.720
like vanilla,

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:09.120
and your lips is naturally

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:12.680
naturally trying to eat.

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:15.040
Come on, prince.

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:16.000
Stop.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:17.240
Don't open your eyes and

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:19.320
keep listening to me, please.

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:25.440
Take small breath.

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:32.240
Sense each other smell.

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:33.440
Nice.

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:43.480
Reach out your lips.

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:47.440
Let the desire build

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:50.200
and taste this cream.

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:53.840
Get away from me!

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:55.200
What the hell?

00:01:57.600 --> 00:01:58.480
Too bad.

00:01:58.480 --> 00:02:00.280
You're just my type.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.400
So you and Gina just

00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:11.800
just... just friends?

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:13.880
Welcome to acting.
